<description>&lt;p&gt;Bomb attacks hit Damascus suburbs and the capital area, killing children and adults, while Israeli troops continue operations in southern Syria, raising tension and the risk of new enemies. Jordan condemned Israeli incursions and sentenced three people to death for a Greek Orthodox church attack. The UN noted that progress in Syria is real but fragile, and OCHA warned Syrians cannot afford more instability. UCDP recorded 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to its count.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE9ydE5xZ1g5SV9vbnY4dzc1bmxkSWVEUFBTdWFZRkN1RUhFWXJUUENIb09OYnpYc0dOOVFlMGpQMEg0YzV4bVdPNg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxQM1dHMVdKTGxYRUFxYURFelNiTWlEdXcxMG9vb25BT29hNjhOaG9XSV92TVpxb2V2bGpwT1BvZTNiUjF1dDlIUzNkek80anFYTmF3TnY1WHR1bXpwRExUMXoySGpObXIwSEJ3ZTJCakhBY1dEajhRamRXMDdCbVhMSjlLTEcwSVdVeWk2TlI0ZlRKb2M2WTV1cVNjRjJWbF9paDBmZEswSk1vYVZEQzJ6RHN3?oc=5&quot;&gt;OCHA&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMibkFVX3lxTE9HYS1ZOVVsQVJLeTRWMmY3WjJHZXZsMnFIZ1VvRkVLUkNVaU9qQ3NucVpqbGJuRkp2cXBPMDZJMFMzb0ltNUo5RVY4dDZfYjlJYWFuM1ZlTVJCd3htM24zc1RBY003NXRYZzBmTnNn?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Jerusalem Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxNaXBtRnlpTVNYcm94a3dudGplRHloZ2RqQ3V4bXNYcUxudG5vRFNTb0kyYlpiZENrbDdvZkYyaEo1TlpPYktNcGJjZjViQXd2MWtBbVVuQmVqMTRkYld0Wk5xWUhiOGVNeHBlUkpOaUMwQzBFNS1TNk1SZmQ2cXlaUkVsMU5ZcjJicmNvV0h0dXRBekVfd3RGQVFOZldqbWtBNUt3X2JHaUFuWGdSc2VOcDVSMA?oc=5&quot;&gt;FDD's Long War Journal&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTFBvdF8zeXJyWDdoNE9zQlpYWjV